# OpenAPI client placeholder

Generated API code belongs in `src/app/api/generated/`. Keep generated files separate from hand-written feature code so they can be safely replaced when the backend contract changes.

When an OpenAPI document is available, generate a TypeScript Angular client with:

```bash
npx @openapitools/openapi-generator-cli generate \
  -i http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs \
  -g typescript-angular \
  -o src/app/api/generated
```

Import generated services through a small application-owned adapter instead of coupling feature components directly to generated code.
